@base = http://localhost:5081
@token = paste-token-from-registration
@project = paste-project-id
@task = paste-task-id

### Register a fictional organization; password is a local example
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"organization":"Demo Guild","email":"neo@example.test","password":"DemoPassword123!"}

### Create project as Owner
POST {{base}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Quest board"}

### Create task
POST {{base}}/api/projects/{{project}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Build the API"}

### Record one hour
POST {{base}}/api/tasks/{{task}}/time
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"seconds":3600}

### Complete task; replay with version 1 returns 409
PUT {{base}}/api/tasks/{{task}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"completed":true,"version":1}
